# The repository root already ignores these for git's sake. This file exists
# because Tailwind v4 decides what to scan for class names by walking the Vite
# root (this folder) and honouring the .gitignore files it finds *inside* it -
# it never sees the one a level up. Without this, Tailwind scans its own
# client/dist output, so a class deleted from src/ keeps being generated from
# the last bundle and a fixed mistake looks unfixed.
node_modules/
dist/
*.local
